      <header class="mb-4">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">WhatsApp Messaging</p>
      </header>

      <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
        Before publishing this URL to Meta, replace the bracketed operator and
